of England, Mayfly is packed with northern charm and contains lots of subtle references to British popular culture. How many can you find?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro UI:</strong> A user interface which gently evokes feelings of gaming nostalgia, with an added layer of modern polish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/extras/67971080514c773db3fe63a88451066a.poster.avif?t=1785534815\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/extras/67971080514c773db3fe63a88451066a.webm?t=1785534815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/extras/67971080514c773db3fe63a88451066a.mp4?t=1785534815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Mayfly has been fully tested with USB-connected XBox &amp; PlayStation controllers and is also Steam Deck compatible.</i></p>", "short_description": "Mayfly is an eerie story-based quiet horror set aboard a narrowboat in Northern England. Upon waking alone to find your husband is missing you find yourself weaving through a shifting, unstable reality as you search your confined surroundings in this focussed narrative exploration game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/96ddf47c8906c20218b4e55ea297c1171b6c000d/header.jpg?t=1785534815", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/514c18bfbb555b71fb24a94627153a9f9be1a539/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785534815", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057470/514c18bfbb555b71fb24a9462